question_en:
The attachment is a close-up photo of an old microscope in the school biology laboratory.

1. Please identify its brand and model, and find the microscope product catalog on the brand's official website.

2. Find brand-new complete microscope units in this version of the catalog, excluding accessories, standalone imagers, slides, specimen kits, and second-hand items. For the above candidate products, uniformly view the default main image in this version of the catalog. Which products simultaneously meet the following conditions?

- The arm and base body are white, silver, or light gray;
- There is a tubular straight-view eyepiece at the top;
- There is a quadrilateral black horizontal stage below the objective lens;
- A circular focusing wheel is visible behind the stage, and it is larger than the stage control knobs.

Please list the names of the products that meet the conditions.

3. Based on the maximum magnification and price in this version of the catalog and the linked product pages, filter the products that match the appearance criteria to those with a maximum magnification of at least 1000×, then select the three with the lowest prices. If prices are the same, sort first by maximum magnification from high to low, then by English name. Please provide the names and maximum magnifications of the three products in order.

Answer format: For Question 1, provide the brand, model, and official catalog link in text; for Question 2, list all products matching the appearance criteria in text; for Question 3, list the names and maximum magnifications of the three products in a table in the specified order.
